ressed, companies eventually realized that they could collect small pieces of information from a user\u2019s technological habits, and use that to form a profile of the user of some sort. I used a packet-monitoring service to listen in on third-party applications and wrote a script to filter out relevant pieces of data that were being sent back to an application\u2019s server. The findings of this study concluded that third-party iOS applications have unmonitored power to access pieces of information like contacts, location, and emails.","topics":[],"score":180150,"global_rank":405894},{"name":"dustyjewett/igdb-api-proxy","owner":"dustyjewett","html_url":"https://github.com/dustyjewett/igdb-api-proxy","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"A docker image for proxying requests from a client to igdb.","topics":[],"score":180150,"global_rank":405895},{"name":"stevengum/arm-templates-for-samples","owner":"stevengum","html_url":"https://github.com/stevengum/arm-templates-for-samples","stars":0,"forks":1,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"For soliciting feedback on ARM templates","topics":[],"score":180148,"global_rank":405897},{"name":"sameerajayasoma/url-parser","owner":"sameerajayasoma","html_url":"https://github.com/sameerajayasoma/url-parser","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"Ballerina URL parser ","topics":[],"score":180146,"global_rank":405898},{"name":"sharpmachine/lightningandthunder.org","owner":"sharpmachine","html_url":"https://github.com/sharpmachine/lightningandthunder.org","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"PHP","description":null,"topics":[],"score":180146,"global_rank":405900},{"name":"brandonbloom/nsgraphs","owner":"brandonbloom","html_url":"https://github.com/brandonbloom/nsgraphs","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Clojure","description":null,"topics":[],"score":180144,"global_rank":405901},{"name":"9ete/tw